@startuml
title gDiagram — UI Interaction Flows

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #37474F
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #90A4AE
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #1565C0
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #ECEFF1

actor User
participant "MainWindow\n(header bar, tabs, Adw.Breakpoint,\nTemplateGallery, RecentFilesManager)" as MW
participant "DocumentView\n(GtkSourceView editor)" as DV
participant "OutlineController /\nElementPalette\n(left sidebar)" as Left
participant "PreviewPane" as PP
participant "PropertiesPanel\n(right sidebar)" as Props
participant "ElementInspector /\nMermaidElementInspector" as Insp
participant "SourceEdit" as SE
participant "GitGutterController" as Git
participant "DiagramEngine" as Eng
participant "gdiagram-lsp\n(LspServer /\nLspDocumentState)" as LSP
participant "VS Code\nextension" as VSC

== Window & layout ==

User -> MW : open / new
MW -> DV : new (per tab)
DV -> DV : build layout: left Adw.OverlaySplitView\n(Outline | Palette, filter, stats footer),\neditor | PreviewPane in a Gtk.Paned,\nright Adw.OverlaySplitView (properties)
User -> MW : narrow window
MW -> DV : set_narrow()

== Live editing & rendering ==

User -> DV : types in editor
DV -> Git : schedule_diff_refresh()
DV -> DV : schedule_render() → Debouncer
DV -> DV : render_preview()
DV -> Eng : detect_format(), preprocess(),\ndetect_plantuml_type() / detect_mermaid_type()
DV -> Left : set_diagram_type()
DV -> Eng : render(type, format, source)
Eng --> DV : RenderResult (status, surface, AST, errors)
DV -> DV : apply_render_result(result)
DV -> DV : PARSE_ERROR / EMPTY / UNKNOWN:\nerror highlights + placeholder text
DV -> DV : OK: update_ui_after_render()\n(stats, lint, validate, complexity)
DV -> Left : update(type, ast)
DV -> Props : refresh(type, ast, last_regions)
DV -> PP : set_surface(surface)
DV -> PP : add_region() per\nElementRegion
PP --> User : diagram displayed

== Click-to-source & properties ==

User -> PP : click element
PP -> PP : hit test
PP -> DV : element_clicked(name, line)
DV -> Props : show_element(name, line)
Props -> Insp : inspect()
Insp --> Props : ElementInfo
DV -> DV : search_and_navigate(name)\n(else navigate_to_line)
DV --> User : identifier selected in editor

User -> Props : edit label / stereotype / colour / rename
Props -> Insp : set_label() ...
Insp --> Props : new source
Props -> DV : source_edited(new_text)
DV -> SE : replace_source_text → replace_text(buffer, new_text)
SE -> SE : replace only the changed middle inside\nbegin/end_user_action = ONE undo step\n(the source text stays the single source of truth)
SE --> DV : buffer changed → re-render (see above)

== Outline & palette ==

User -> Left : outline row
Left -> DV : navigate_to_element()
DV --> User : element selected in editor

User -> Left : palette button
Left -> DV : snippet_activated()
DV -> SE : insert_snippet(buffer, text, select, insert_type)
SE -> SE : insert above the closing end line\n(PaletteCatalog snippet), select placeholder,\none undo step
SE --> DV : buffer changed → re-render

== Git gutter ==

User -> DV : toggle blame / diff
DV -> Git : set_blame_active() / set_diff_marks_active()
Git -> Git : git blame (porcelain) and\ngit diff (unified=0)
Git --> User : blame column + diff marks

== Separate consumers: LSP server and headless CLI ==

VSC -> LSP : spawn (stdio)
VSC -> LSP : didChange
LSP -> Eng : parse()
Eng --> LSP : ParseResult
LSP --> VSC : diagnostics
VSC -> LSP : renderSvg
LSP -> Eng : generate_svg()
Eng --> LSP : SVG
User -> Eng : gdiagram file.puml -e out.png -f png\n(Application.run_headless_export, no GTK window)

@enduml
